GUID

UUID generation and handling.

Static Methods:
  V4(rng)                     - Generate random UUID v4
  V7(rng)                     - Generate time-based UUID v7
  V8(rng, high, low, family, node) - Generate custom UUID v8

Methods:
  ToUInt()                    - Convert to Int128
  ToHex()                     - Convert to hex string
  ToByteArray()               - Convert to byte array

Properties:
  Version                     - UUID version number
  Variant                     - UUID variant number
  High, Low, Family, Node     - UUID segment values
  HighHex, LowHex, FamilyHex, NodeHex - Hex representations